From 224fa8b87691c7a0b89090ff01aabcddd4fd8d49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:42:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Stop paging held lists in Kotlin

Android Auto kept each open album's detail, cut the car's pages from its
main release's tracks and counted them. Each page of an album's tracks is
now one SQL read at the car's offset, and a live count of them in SQL tells
the car when they change. Nothing pages or counts a held list any more, so
the held detail reads and the projection that kept them are gone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
